"""Reuse explicit checkpoint; only the two affected native-layout paths."""
import hashlib
from pathlib import Path
original=Path('/home/qhq/serverless_llm_experiment/results/ieee_tc/dlora_qualification/d774_20261024/backup.py')
data=original.read_bytes()
assert hashlib.sha256(data).hexdigest()=='b5c70e16e8bd04fc8f3f5868a4d9696e197cd91f09293a2a4a613ebd7d7049e1'
source=data.decode()
changes={
    'd774_dlora_native_timing':'d778_dlora_native_layout',
    '== [0,0]':'== [0]',
    '84bb7892b4aade6bed0b898fb99d1f6074073a10':'f9c0e79c1dae868648fe7e7cb5d194a0ac10b449',
    '57be5a751304642b76e226f9b19e84f8e941519a':'bc9719ec6068ecd0ea03074e513022625ad752bf',
    "             'scripts/prepare_ieee_tc_serverless_stack.py',\n":'',
    'tc: observe native dLoRA token timelines across migration (D774)':
        'tc: read native dLoRA layer-major adapter pool correctly (D778)',
    "         'shared_regression.log','qualify.py'":"         'qualify.py'",
    "manifest = dict(schema='ieee_tc_dlora_native_timing_cpu_qualification_v1',":
        "with (OUT/'.gitattributes').open('xb') as handle:\n    handle.write((RAW/'snapshot.gitattributes').read_bytes())\nfiles['.gitattributes']=dict(source=str(RAW/'snapshot.gitattributes'),sha256=p.digest(OUT/'.gitattributes'))\nmanifest = dict(schema='ieee_tc_dlora_native_layout_cpu_qualification_v1',",
    'tests=dict(dlora=12, shared_slora_regression=30, passed=True)':
        'tests=dict(affected_owned_runtime=7, passed=True, native_constructor_shape_only=True)',
    'D774_DLORA_NATIVE_TIMING_20261024.md':'D778_DLORA_NATIVE_LAYOUT_CORRECTION_20261024.md',
    'tc: preserve dLoRA native timing qualification and scope (D774)':
        'tc: document native dLoRA layout measurement correction (D778)',
    'backup/d774-dlora-native-timing-20261024':'backup/d778-dlora-native-layout-20261024',
}
for old,new in changes.items():
    assert source.count(old)==1,old
    source=source.replace(old,new)
needle="assert call(BASE,'git','branch','--show-current') == 'main'"
check="""for path in q['source_view']['measured_sha256']:
    checked=subprocess.run(['git','diff','--no-index','--check',str(native/path),str(view/path)],
        capture_output=True,text=True)
    assert checked.returncode in (0,1) and not checked.stdout and not checked.stderr,path
"""
assert source.count(needle)==1
source=source.replace(needle,check+needle)
exec(compile(source,str(original),'exec'),{'__name__':'__main__','__file__':str(Path(__file__))})
